    <headline>High temperature Belgrade orange</headline>
    <description>Maximum temperature ≥ 35°C</description>
    <instruction>Very dangerous weather condition, especially when persisting for several consecutive days. Unfavourable weather conditions for people suffering from chronic illnesses, those under medical treatment or supervision, as well as meteoropaths. Animals are also at risk. Unfavourable conditions for electricity supply. Traffic disruptions are possible.</instruction>
    <web>https://www.meteoalarm.rs/eng/meteo_alarm.php</web>
